  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "IndusInd Bank Indulge Credit Card is a premium card with a pure 22K gold inlay and no pre-set spending limit. It offers benefits across multiple categories such as dining, travel, lifestyle, and entertainment, making it an all-rounder option for high spenders. While the card caters to various categories, its reward rate is comparatively low at 1.5% , especially when compared to similar cards like HDFC Diners Club Black (3.33% value-back) and ICICI Emeralde Private (3% value-back). However, the card somewhat compensates for the lower earning rate by offering reward redemption at a 1:1 ratio (1 RP = Rs. 1) against cashback. Besides rewards, the card offers limited travel benefits, such as a low forex markup fee of 1.8% and 16 complimentary international lounge visits per year. Whereas, other cards with a similar annual fee offer unlimited international lounge visits worldwide, which gives them an edge for frequent travellers. However, the Indulge Card enhances its overall value with lifestyle benefits like unlimited complimentary golf games & lessons,free movie tickets , and dining discounts. Overall, IndusInd Bank Indulge Credit Card is a reasonable option for high spenders who are looking for a card with premium lifestyle benefits.",
